  "title": "ESA WorldCereal",
  "description": "The ESA WorldCereal dataset provides farm point locations derived from 10-meter resolution global crop type classification maps, covering maize, winter cereals, and spring cereals. Points are partitioned by administrative boundaries (levels 0 and 1) and distributed in cloud-native GeoParquet format. The dataset contains nearly 7 million features spanning a near-global extent.",
